<title>CZECH REPUBLIC: CZECH JAN-FEB TRADE DEFICIT CZK 27.2 BLN. [CORRECTED 08:45 GMT]</title>
<headline>CZECH JAN-FEB TRADE DEFICIT CZK 27.2 BLN. [CORRECTED 08:45 GMT]</headline>
<dateline>PRAGUE 1997-03-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Czech Republic posted a</p>
<p>January-February trade deficit of 27.178 billion crowns,</p>
<p>compared to a 16.233 billion crown deficit for the same period</p>
<p>in 1996, the Czech Statistical Bureau (CSU) said on Monday.</p>
<p>The CSU added in a statement that it revised the January</p>
<p>deficit to 13.485 billion crowns from a previously reported</p>
<p>shortfall of 13.597 billion.</p>
<p> CZECH FOREIGN TRADE   JAN-FEB 97   JAN 97	  JAN-FEB 96</p>
<p>  imports (CZK bln)     123.054   59.899  (60.042)  112.775</p>
<p>  exports		    95.876   46.414  (46.445)   96.542</p>
<p>  balance		   -27.178   -13.485(-13.597)  -16.233</p>
<p>(Corrects JAN-FEB 96 comparative figures.)</p>
<p>Note. All figures in billions of crowns on customs-cleared</p>
<p>basis and subject to revision. Previously reported January</p>
<p>figures in brackets.</p>
<p> (FOR JAN-FEB PERIOD)	   imports     exports     balance</p>
<p>BY TERRITORY (in billions of crowns)</p>
<p>Countries with a</p>
<p>  developed market economy     84.852	62.672     -22.180</p>
<p>   of that: EU countries	 75.135	57.775     -17.360</p>
<p>  Developing countries	    6.517	 4.292	-2.225</p>
<p>European countries with transitional economy, and</p>
<p>  CIS countries		    29.746	28.526	-1.220</p>
<p>Other countries with transitional or state</p>
<p>  economies			   1.845	 0.303	-1.551</p>
<p>  Unspecified countries	   0.085	 0.083	 0.002</p>
<p>  Total			     123.054	95.876     -27.178</p>
<p>   of that: OECD countries     92.316	70.014     -22.302</p>
<p>BY PRODUCT GROUPS (in billions of crowns)</p>
<p>Agricultural products</p>
<p>  and foodstuffs		  9.701	   5.089    -4.612</p>
<p>Raw materials, unprocessed goods</p>
<p>  and chemical products	54.009	  42.968   -11.041</p>
<p>Machinery and</p>
<p>  transport equipment	  44.905	  34.334   -10.571</p>
<p>Industrial consumer</p>
<p>  products			 14.439	  13.485    -0.954</p>
<p>  Total			    123.054	 95.876   -27.178</p>
<p>  Total index 1997/96 (pct)  109.1	   99.3</p>
<p>Note. All figures in billions of crowns on customs-cleared</p>
<p>basis and subject to revision.</p>
<p>-- Prague Newsroom, 420-2-2423-0003</p>
</text>
